 [CRISTAL WHIMPERING]

484
00:20:12.077 --> 00:20:13.311
 She'll be back.

485
00:20:16.247 --> 00:20:18.081
 [DOOR CLOSES]

486
00:20:18.082 --> 00:20:19.517
<i>HUEY:
 I guess, deep down,</i>

487
00:20:19.518 --> 00:20:22.085
<i>all grownups want to find
 that perfect person</i>

488
00:20:22.086 --> 00:20:24.388
<i>that'll guarantee that they'll
 never be lonely again.</i>

489
00:20:24.389 --> 00:20:28.226
<i>I still believe Granddad'll
 find his someday.</i>

490
00:20:29.795 --> 00:20:32.463
 [SNORING]

491
00:20:35.433 --> 00:20:37.001
 Did she come back?

492
00:20:37.002 --> 00:20:39.303
Don't blow out the candle.
She'll think nobody's home.

493
00:20:39.304 --> 00:20:41.839
 It's all right, Granddad.

494
00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.707
 Maybe she'll be back tomorrow.

495
00:20:43.708 --> 00:20:44.843
 [BLOWS]

496
00:20:47.345 --> 00:20:48.946
<i>HUEY:
 One thing I learned though...</i>

497
00:20:48.947 --> 00:20:50.614
 Come back!

498
00:20:50.615 --> 00:20:52.149
 Wait!

499
00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.853
 [LAUGHING]

500
00:20:56.421 --> 00:20:58.488
 Run, bitch, run!

501
00:20:58.489 --> 00:21:00.958
<i>She sure can run
 in those heels.</i>

502
00:21:00.959 --> 00:21:03.293
 CRISTAL:
 I can't go to school!

503
00:21:03.294 --> 00:21:05.863
 I can't get no real job!

504
00:21:05.864 --> 00:21:08.532
[A PIMP NAMED SLICKBACK LAUGHS]

505
00:21:08.533 --> 00:21:10.402
 A PIMP NAMED SLICKBACK:
 Feel the burn.

506
00:21:12.771 --> 00:21:14.772
 [?]